    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your body begins to adapt to toxins and venoms, ignoring their corrupting effects. You have Immunity to Poison damage and to the Poisoned condition.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can temporarily adapt to your own hemocraft. As a Bonus Action, you can ignore the Side Effect of one mutagen affecting you for 1 minute. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
